==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Latin, Italian ''[[venire]]'' and French ''[[venir]]''

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|ven}}

# to [[come]]
#: Mi venus al via partio, sed mi malsanigis la gripon.
#: ''I would come to your party, but I contracted influenza.''

===See also===
* [[alveni]], to [[arrive]]
* [[deveni]], to [[originate]], to come from
* [[elveni]], to come out, to exit
* [[enveni]], to come into, to enter
* [[kunveni]], to [[gather]], to [[congregate]]
* [[reveni]], to [[return]]; to come back

